{
  "scope": "Sequential fresh before/selected servers, same frozen clients, four workers and default limits. Three repetitions; workload order rotates and implementation order alternates. Server CPUs 0-3 and clients 4-7. Inspection cases hold 8192 separate idle rooms and one private pair, 1KiB values/window16 for 8 seconds: private has no churn; churn adds eight reconnect workers; management adds 200 HTTP inspections/s. Shared cases use 1024 additional global-room peers and three 3-second private phases before/during/after population, with complete ordered departure/Close/EOF checks outside routing timing. All full payload/FIFO/counter/resource checks must pass. No builds, profilers or other load tests overlap timing. Allocation diagnostics are separate.",
